<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="kbd" data-kv-variant="navigation-guide" data-klic-component="kbd" class="kn-kbd"><div data-part="tabs"><div role="tablist" aria-label="보기" ><button type="button" role="tab" id="kv-export-kbd-kbd-navigation-guide-tab-0" aria-controls="kv-export-kbd-kbd-navigation-guide-panel-0" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" data-kv-action="tab" data-part="btn">개요</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="kv-export-kbd-kbd-navigation-guide-tab-1" aria-controls="kv-export-kbd-kbd-navigation-guide-panel-1" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-kv-action="tab" data-part="btn">활동</button></div><section role="tabpanel" id="kv-export-kbd-kbd-navigation-guide-panel-0" aria-labelledby="kv-export-kbd-kbd-navigation-guide-tab-0" ><p data-part="muted">프로젝트 개요입니다.</p></section><section role="tabpanel" id="kv-export-kbd-kbd-navigation-guide-panel-1" aria-labelledby="kv-export-kbd-kbd-navigation-guide-tab-1" hidden><p data-part="muted">최근 팀 활동입니다.</p></section></div><p data-part="muted"><kbd>←</kbd> <kbd>→</kbd> 탭 이동 · <kbd>Home</kbd> 첫 탭</p></div>
